      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         BROOK END                                              north side 5/304                                        The Laurels                                              II House. Early C19, red brick, slate roof, and chimneys. 2-storeys. 3 bays of sash windows. 4 panes wide to sides, 3 panes to centre, slender glazing bars, flat brick arches to ground floor, modern shutters. Central 6-panelled door( 2 upper panels glazed) in doorcase with shallow fluted pilasters, frieze with diamond motif, and hood on curved brackets. Listing NGR: SP8582211089"
    }
